OL,3,GNEWSAPeter Rabbit trail auction
OL,4,A'exceeded expectations'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn auction of Peter Rabbit sculptures
OL,7,Fwhich formed a city trail during summer
OL,8,F"totally exceeded our expectations",
OL,9,Fthe charity behind it has said.
OL,11,FThe 96 rabbits were dotted around
OL,12,FNewcastle and North Tyneside for nine
OL,13,Fweeks, with people encouraged to visit
OL,14,Fand snap a photo of each one.
OL,16,FSt Oswalds Hospice said it raised
OL,17,F#300,000 from selling the sculptures to
OL,18,Fbidders on Tuesday night, which it said
OL,19,Fwas the highest performing auction it
OL,20,Fever had.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
