OL,3,GNEWSAPeter Rabbit trail auction
OL,4,A'exceeded expectations'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHead of fundraising Jane Hogan said:
OL,7,F"Today, I'm still very much in the
OL,8,Fmindset 'we cannot top this' - but
OL,9,Fpeople remind me I say that every
OL,10,Ftime."
